{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1490018-the-hauns-and-the-living","id":1490018,"title":"The hauns and the living...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-13T06:09:10-07:00","id":1490018,"title":"The hauns and the living...","content":"Haunts are always hostile places for the living? Even if the wraith is a benevolent spirit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T07:16:32-07:00","id":1490022,"title":"","content":"No, not necessarily as far as I'm aware of. A haunt is a group of Wraith's &quot;headquarters&quot;, where they shelter themselves, so in the skinlands it becomes a place that people think it's creepy or a haunted house since the shroud in haunts is thinner. Or like those ghost reality shows: &quot;(insert place here),the most haunted prison in the United States!&quot;<br /> <br /> Of course, the Wraith in the Haunt <i>CAN </i>make it very hostile for anyone living there if they want to...<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27541-heavywhiskey","name":"HeavyWhiskey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T01:14:03-07:00","id":1490103,"title":"","content":"A haunt is just like it sounds - it's a haunted house or other haunted places. It is just a place where the Shroud is weak.<br /> <br /> While there are certainly (fictional) haunted houses that are terrifying and dangerous to the living (think Richard Matheson's book and film Hell House, the Amityville Horror, Shirley Jackson's The Haunting of Hill House, and many others), most haunted houses are not dangerous. Many are not even &quot;spooky&quot;. There are loads of many real life haunted opera houses, theatres, restaurants, hotels, and other public places. Many people live in supposedly haunted homes, and aren't bothered by it at all. Only a relative few haunted places have disturbing enough events that cause people to leave.<br /> <br /> In terms of Wraith, it just depends on the type of ghosts that live there and whether they want to prey on the living, or cooperate on them. It probably depends on their Passions and possibly the nature of their Fetters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T04:42:07-07:00","id":1490117,"title":"","content":"What the others said- a good Haunt for Wraiths is a place where big emotions happen, so they can gather Pathos. Those emotions don't have to be necessarily negative, and some Wraiths don't want to wait for emotions to happen, but provoke them by using their Arcanoi. I think one example in Wr20 is a wrestling arena.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}